}-3 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 18\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-12 \\\\ -10 \\\\ k\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{1}+9{x}_{2}=-12 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+7{x}_{2}=-10 \\\\ -6{x}_{1}+18{x}_{2}=k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo solve the system above, we set up and row reduce an augmented matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & [\\begin{aligned}-3 & 9 & -12 \\\\ -2 & 7 & -10 \\\\ -6 & 18 & k\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=-\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 4 \\\\ -2 & 7 & -10 \\\\ -6 & 18 & k\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -6 & 18 & k\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+6{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & k+24\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe third row of the augmented matrix now corresponds to the equation $0{x}_{1}+0{x}_{2}=k+24.$ Therefore, the system has a solution only if\n\n$$\n0=k+24\\,⇒\\,k=-24.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120563 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186120565 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120563 #edb/ref 1061 10219 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120563 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3a2275fb-e73e-5073-a025-2bc601b975e5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120563 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186120996 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120564 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186120566 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120564 #edb/ref 1061 10220 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120564 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b35664ff-b09b-5220-918b-2c8fac890599" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120564 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186119737 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120565 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186120564 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120565 #edb/ref 1061 10223 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120565 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "74513b9e-8519-5ff5-ab8f-35309ad2f2c3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120565 #edb/ref 1063